("🌐","Web / front-end developer","Builds the websites and web apps people use every day.","HTML, CSS, JavaScript, GitHub, deploying, testing on phones","Learn JavaScript properly and a framework like React",sal(2476,"2612-multimedia-specialists-and-web-developers","Multimedia Specialists and Web Developers"),"Private + government"),
("💻","Software engineer","Designs and builds bigger software systems: apps, platforms, the tech inside banks, airlines and government services.","Prompting and reading code, change control, branches and pull requests, testing","Learn Python, then HSC Software Engineering",sal(2537,"2613-software-and-applications-programmers","Software and Applications Programmers"),"Private + government"),
